        "procedure": "Phen-Gd was prepared analogously to Phen-Eu: Phen (0.121 g, 0.2 mmol) and Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.135 g, 0.3 mmol) were dissolved in DMF (15 mL) and methanol (10 mL), stirred for 0.5 h, then refluxed in an oil bath at 80 °C for 8 h. After cooling to room temperature, the solution was filtered and left undisturbed; X-ray quality crystals formed after 7 days, were washed with methanol and dried.",
