        "summary": "Linear Gd3 cluster with weak ferromagnetic exchange at low T (J = +3.82(2) cm−1) after high-T antiferromagnetic Curie–Weiss behaviour; significant magnetocaloric effect with −ΔSm = 23.42 J kg−1 K−1 at 7 T and 2 K, close to the theoretical 24.22 J kg−1 K−1, supporting cryogenic magnetic refrigeration.",
